Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:59.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《超凡蜘蛛侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:03.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,5 4 3\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five, four, three...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.23,0:01:05.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,2 1\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:08.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗 我来咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready or not, here I come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:24.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.97,0:02:27.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.34,0:03:32.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得跟你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll stay with Aunt May...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:33.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯父伯母住一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and Uncle Ben for a little while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:36.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想和你们一起 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wanna go with you. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.29,0:03:42.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做三明治要去掉面包皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't like crust on his sandwiches...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:45.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上睡觉他喜欢留点光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he likes to sleep with a little light on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛丽 走吧 走吧 - 我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mary. Come on, come on. - Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:52.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:55.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要听话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:14.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:15.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 弗莱舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Flash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:21.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:30.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你是彼得 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. It's Peter, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:33.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常喜欢你的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really like your photos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thanks. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:36.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:37.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你周五晚上有空吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are you busy Friday night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:46.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 你能给我男朋友的车拍些照片么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool. Can you take pictures of my boyfriend's car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:48.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的 我就是想挑张好的裱起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I really wanna frame a good one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:49.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,送给他当生日礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for his birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:52.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对他可真好啊 喔 想法非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's really nice of you. wow, that's such a nice thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.51,0:04:55.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我会看一下我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'll have a look at the old....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:57.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的时间表 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The old schedule. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:04:59.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么了老师 - 你还想要你的滑板么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir? - You want to keep that skateboard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:03.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要的 - 那就轮子朝天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Keep it off the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:04.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 嗯 - 别着地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sure. Yeah. - Wheels up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:05.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:07.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没错 - 明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:36.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃掉 吃掉 吃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat it! Eat it! Eat it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:37.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃掉 吃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat it! Eat it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:39.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃掉 吃掉 吃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat it! Eat it! Eat it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的菜吃掉 戈登 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat your vegetables, Gordon. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:43.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:45.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 帕克 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Parker, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:46.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拍张照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a picture of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:50.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不会拍这种照片 把他放下来 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not gonna take a picture of it. Put him down, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.71,0:05:51.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来吧 - 戈登 别吃 别吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Gordon, don't eat it, don't eat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:53.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拍一张吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.49,0:05:54.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放他下来 弗莱舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him down, Flash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:56.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拍照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:05:59.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放下他 尤金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him down, Eugene!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:03.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:08.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站起来啊帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, Parker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:13.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不会拍那照片的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still not taking the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.49,0:06:19.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,趴着吧 帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down, Parker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:21.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁敢挡我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants one more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:23.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来啊 - 弗莱舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One more! - Flash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:24.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弗莱舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flash...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.58,0:06:27.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们今天放学计划仍旧不变吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we still on for after school today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:28.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我家 三点半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My house, 3:30?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:30.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你做了作业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you did homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:31.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time, I was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:33.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你可非常失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...disappointed in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:35.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 行啊 闪开 - 不 咱先去上课怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, move. - No, how about we go to class?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.87,0:06:37.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:41.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:08.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你刚刚做的很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that was great what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:10.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有点傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was stupid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:12.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it was great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.47,0:07:15.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好去一趟医务室 你可能会得脑震荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should go to the nurse. You might have a concussion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:18.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:20.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我的名字吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know my name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.03,0:07:22.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I know your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:24.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想知道你还知不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know if you know your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:27.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 帕克 彼得?帕克 - 好的 好 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Parker. Peter Parker. - Okay. Okay, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:40.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我还是会去医务室的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd still go to the nurse though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:41.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是格温 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Gwen, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:43.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格温·斯泰茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gwen Stacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.95,0:07:44.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.51,0:07:50.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚做意面和肉丸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm making spaghetti and meatballs tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:53.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗 意大利面和肉丸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're serious? Spaghetti and meatballs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:57.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候开始不喜欢意面和肉丸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when don't you like spaghetti and meatballs, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:00.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦我的天 - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God. - What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:01.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的脸怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to your face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.81,0:08:04.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 摔一跤而已 滑板的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right. Just-- I fell, skating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:05.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:09.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本恩·帕克 你想把这脏兮兮的盒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ben Parker, don't you even...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:12.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丢在我的厨房里门都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...think about leaving that filthy box in my kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:13.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些可是我的保龄球奖品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My bowling trophies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:14.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 好吧 那当然可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, then, by all means...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请一定要把这脏兮兮的盒子放在厨房里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Ieave that box in my kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:18.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 发生什么事了你 - 他摔倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to you? - He fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:21.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来都搞不懂小屁孩为什么要玩那些玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you kids ride those things, I'll never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:23.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为那很傻很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's stupid and dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:25.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我们犯傻的时候么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when we were stupid and dangerous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:25.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不记得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.81,0:08:27.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 相信我 我们是过来人 - 好吧 很高兴知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Trust me, we were. - All right. Good to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:29.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里发洪水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the flood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:31.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟上 我带你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me. I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.23,0:08:32.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你确定 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You serious? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:33.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是冷凝器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think it's the condenser tray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:41.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水太多 损坏了冷凝器或者热传导管道系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too much water for the condenser tray or the heat exchange tubing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是没过水位线了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This has got to be the fill line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有这才说的通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the only thing that makes any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:46.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能修好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you fix it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:50.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 今晚不行 我明天去趟五金店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not tonight. I'll go by the hardware store tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.54,0:08:52.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了 顺便把这个敷脸上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good deal. And meanwhile, put this on your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:56.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个动手的家伙怎样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's the other guy look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:09:00.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧 我一看就知道怎么回事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I know a right cross when I see one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.57,0:09:04.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说还是不说 要我打小报告给你爹地么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes or no? Do I have to call somebody's father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:06.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别 别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:07.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:09.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会告诉你梅伯母的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I wouldn't tell your Aunt May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:13.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,惹火她的小鬼都太可怜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pity the poor kid who'd have to suffer her wrath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.65,0:09:17.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你上来之前 再看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you come up, see if...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:19.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有没有修一下还能再用的东西 - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...there's anything else worth saving. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:38.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 水管工不负责修家电啊 - 不 他们也修的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Plumbers don't fix appliances. - Yes, they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:39.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们只负责修管子和抽水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They fix pipes and pump things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:41.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你让他们修\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ask them to--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.93,0:09:48.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我都把那东西忘光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot all about that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:50.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你爸爸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was your dad's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:52.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 - 他叫我们替他好好保管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - He asked us to keep it safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:59.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在第九大道上的一家皮具店的橱窗里看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saw it in the window of that leather shop over on 9th Avenue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:03.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才19岁 一个19岁的小孩要个公文包干嘛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was 19. What does a 19-year-old kid need with a briefcase?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:05.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜谁卖给他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And guess who sold it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:07.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不知道 - 你妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - Your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:08.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是这么认识的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how they met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:12.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他让你 好好保管 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asked you to keep this safe? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:13.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里面什么都没有啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.57,0:10:14.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看过这包么 什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you looked? There's nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:17.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸是个很神秘的人 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father was a very secretive man, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.99,0:10:19.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.87,0:10:26.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:27.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是谁么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know who that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和你爸爸一起工作的同事 我猜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some guy who worked with your dad, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:38.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这从桌上拿开吧 好么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just take this off the table, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:41.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们吃饭了 拿走 然后去洗手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna eat. Off. And wash your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:42.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 马上 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:44.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:21.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要做个好孩子 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to be a good boy. Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:23.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:24.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在有些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你妈妈有些事必须要去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...something your mom and I have to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.85,0:12:24.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,零 零 衰变率算法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Zero, zero, decay rate algorithm."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:34.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 马上来 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, one sec, one sec.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:43.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:45.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:48.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好着呢 怎么了 - 哦天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. What's up? - Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:50.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和他太像了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:52.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我能进来吗 - 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I come in? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:12:57.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:00.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我读的书不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I don't have much education.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:01.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.07,0:13:06.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 你十岁时做的功课我就已经不知道怎么辅导了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, I stopped being able to help with your homework when you were 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I'm trying to say is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.54,0:13:11.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道爸爸不在身边的日子很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I know it's been rough for you without your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:14.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道我们很少谈他们的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know we don't talk much about them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 没关系 - 不 当然有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, it's all right. - No, it is not all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:20.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望可以改变 但是我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could change it, but I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:24.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,柯特?康纳斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curt Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:27.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是照片上站在你爸旁边那人的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the name of the guy in the picture with your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:30.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一起工作了很多年 关系很铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They worked together for years and they were close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.84,0:13:32.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但那晚之后我们再没见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But after that night, we never saw him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.11,0:13:35.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他甚至没打过电话来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never even called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:36.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一次都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:40.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去查查看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go figure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.87,0:13:45.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:51.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本恩伯伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:52.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:55.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个很好的爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a pretty great dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:52.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:53.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:54.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么能为您效劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:56.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 呃 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I'm here to see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:58.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是来见康纳斯博士的 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...Dr. Connors. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:00.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在左手边那儿找一下你的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find yourself to the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:04.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是来这实习的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are here for the internship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:06.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.10,0:15:07.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:10.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到你的名牌 左手边位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find your badge to the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.65,0:15:17.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找不到你自己的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having trouble finding yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:19.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Yeah, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:22.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:24.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格韦拉先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Mr. Guevara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:25.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gracias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:26.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}De Nada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.19,0:15:28.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到奥斯集团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Oscorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:32.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,由创始人 诺曼?奥斯本 创建\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born from the mind of our founder, Norman Osborn...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:36.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥斯集团大厦有108层 层层都有新科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... the Oscorp Tower houses 108 floors of innovation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:40.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们运用科技头脑不断拓宽 防御工程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our scientific minds are pushing the boundaries of defence, biomedical...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.65,0:15:44.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,生物医学和化学科技的界限 未来由我们创造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and chemical technologies. The future lies within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:45.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到奥斯集团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Oscorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:47.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是格温·斯泰茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Gwen Stacy, a senior...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:48.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是中城科技高中的毕业班学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...at Midtown Science...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:50.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也是康纳斯博士的实习生领队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and head intern to Dr. Connors.{\r}
