Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.99,0:24:56.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去了 - 我们很担心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got-- - We've been so worried.{\r}
