Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.50,0:25:48.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出大事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something is very wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.97,0:25:49.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.34,0:25:52.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人喜欢吃你的肉卷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody likes your meat loaf.{\r}
