Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.32,0:26:14.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,37年前你就该告诉我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have said that to me 37 years ago.{\r}
