Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.73,0:29:12.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.34,0:29:15.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在做作业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.71,0:29:16.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.42,0:29:17.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
