Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.65,0:29:34.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是那天的实习生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The intern from the other day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.20,0:29:36.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 没错 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah. That's right, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.59,0:29:39.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我确定你非常优秀 但这是我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you're very nice, but this is a home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.32,0:29:41.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想请你到我办公室预约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ask you to make an appointment with my office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.67,0:29:42.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是理查德?帕克的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Richard Parker's son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.54,0:29:51.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.27,0:29:56.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我恐怕帮不了你多少 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I can't help you much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.61,0:29:59.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道为什么他们离开 也不知道他们去了哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know why they left or where they were going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.09,0:30:03.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,反应很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good reflexes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.66,0:30:04.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢夸奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.96,0:30:11.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢你 - 我读了你的书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - I read your book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.99,0:30:12.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.71,0:30:15.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,写得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's something, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.48,0:30:16.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you really think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.11,0:30:19.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 觉得有可能么 跨物种遗传学 - 是的 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...it's possible, cross-species genetics? - Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.99,0:30:22.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外界都在嘲笑你父亲和我研究出的理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father and l were mocked for our theories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.64,0:30:25.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不止是广大群众 也包括奥斯集团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just in the community at large, but at Oscorp, as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.13,0:30:28.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫我们疯子科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They called us mad scientists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.93,0:30:31.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你父亲繁殖了蜘蛛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then your father bred the spiders...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.48,0:30:32.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and everything changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.68,0:30:34.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结果大出所料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The results were beyond encouraging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.71,0:30:36.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,简直是惊世之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were spectacular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.67,0:30:41.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们本可以改变无数人的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were gonna change the lives of millions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.19,0:30:43.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也包括我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.63,0:30:45.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it was over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.04,0:30:49.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.71,0:30:52.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带着他的研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took his research with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.90,0:30:56.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我知道 没有他我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I knew without him, l....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.91,0:31:05.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.25,0:31:09.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.73,0:31:13.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我远离你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I stayed away from you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.47,0:31:14.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和你的家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.56,0:31:17.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一点我真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for that, I'm truly sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.90,0:31:26.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,假如说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.41,0:31:29.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,假如说这起作用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say it worked.{\r}
