Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.30,0:31:36.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类会继承多少外来物种的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, how much would the foreign species take over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.04,0:31:38.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,副作用会是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What could the side effects be?{\r}
