Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.85,0:31:48.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,衰变率算法上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The decay rate algorithm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.47,0:31:53.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.47,0:31:56.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.56,0:31:57.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.61,0:32:21.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绝世之才啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extraordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.35,0:32:23.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you come up with this?{\r}
