Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.92,0:32:35.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 和我见个面好吗 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...one day after school? - Yeah.{\r}
