Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.20,0:33:13.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你故意的吧 弗莱舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did that on purpose, Flash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.14,0:33:15.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,故意的就好了 你最好小心着点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've. You better watch your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.14,0:33:19.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.53,0:33:23.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.98,0:33:30.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,交出来 帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it up, Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.89,0:33:37.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.75,0:33:40.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One sec.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.93,0:33:46.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 丢过来 伙计 - 你干嘛不来我这拿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, man. - Why don't you take it from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.70,0:33:52.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 拿走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. Take it.{\r}
