Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.30,0:37:17.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 很好 听上去很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, good. Sounds good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.84,0:37:18.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.71,0:37:20.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.30,0:37:24.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不是现在 我现在没空 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't right now, I can't right now. - Yeah, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.01,0:37:25.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我现在有点忙 - 我知道 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm so busy right now. - I know, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.18,0:37:29.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But maybe....{\r}
