Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.45,0:37:36.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 回见 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.13,0:39:07.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有蛋白质结构 核糖体DNA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have protein structure, rDNA...{\r}
