Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.46,0:39:13.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是X射线图像仪 是这世界上唯一的一台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that's X-ray video. That's the only one on the planet. We have....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.77,0:39:15.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那边是人类线谱鉴定器 - 我记得这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Human line testing over-- - I remember that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.66,0:39:17.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我见过这个仪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen that before.{\r}
