Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.64,0:39:22.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我记得在我爸爸办公室的一张照片里看到过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I remember a picture of that in my dad's office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.21,0:39:25.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原理很简单 在这上面加载一个抗原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The idea was so simple. You load it with an antigen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.12,0:39:29.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它制造的反应云可以覆盖于附近一带 甚至整个城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It creates a cloud which can be dispersed over a neighbourhood, even a city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.21,0:39:32.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,理论上来说 你可以用一个下午治好整个城市里的小儿麻痹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoretically, you could cure polio in an afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.80,0:39:33.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.68,0:39:37.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但也有人反对使用 万一这个机器加载了某种有毒物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, others disagreed. What if the device were loaded with a toxin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.21,0:39:39.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你不想参与治疗了 你也没法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you wanted to opt out? You can't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.78,0:39:43.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,逃出这个反应云范围 所以它被弃置在此 任尘土掩埋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...run away from a cloud after all, so here it lies, gathering dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.71,0:39:47.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里看到的 是一只蜥蜴的电脑模型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you see here is a computer model of a lizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.37,0:39:50.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,许多这样的美妙生物已能完美适应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many of these wonderful creatures have so brilliantly adapted...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.73,0:39:53.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们可以随意再生出完整的肢体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that they can regenerate entire limbs at will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.49,0:39:55.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以想象我有多妒忌它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can imagine my envy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.36,0:39:57.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在尝试着驾驭这种能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trying to harness this capability...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.54,0:39:59.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这种能力转到实验对象身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and transfer it into our host subject:{\r}
