Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.58,0:40:09.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要接电话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need to take that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.40,0:40:16.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,系统已准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}System ready...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.64,0:40:18.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,基因转化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for gene insertion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.49,0:40:19.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.34,0:40:21.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来看一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check.{\r}
