Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.23,0:56:35.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,摆脱了 让我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.15,0:56:38.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 等会儿 就等一秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, one second. Hold on, one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.32,0:56:40.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 伙计 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock it off, man. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.93,0:56:43.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 让我走 别玩我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let me go. Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.18,0:56:45.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That isn't funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.42,0:56:47.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 挺好玩儿的嘛 - 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt is kind of funny. - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.79,0:56:59.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样会更麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could've gone a lot worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.35,0:57:00.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now hold still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.55,0:57:08.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蓝衣男孩在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys in blue here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.54,0:57:10.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哟 我抓住他了 - 不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, I got him. - Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.86,0:57:12.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他现在哪儿都去不了 - 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's not going anywhere. - Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.86,0:57:13.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.99,0:57:15.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.73,0:57:17.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你们不明白我戴面具的意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one grasps the concept of the mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.84,0:57:18.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.42,0:57:23.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚替你们完成了80%的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just did 80 percent of your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.03,0:57:23.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.94,0:57:25.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们就是这样回报我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how you repay me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.06,0:57:30.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,呆在那儿别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.49,0:57:52.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 这下好玩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that was fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.77,0:57:55.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,公交车 晚上好啊 亲们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bus! Hey there, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.05,0:58:00.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.91,0:58:06.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 当心点啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, watch out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.12,0:58:08.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在荡秋千\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm swinging here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.31,0:58:27.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 38名纽约市警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So 38 of New York's finest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.42,0:58:30.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对一个紧身衣男束手无策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...versus one guy in a unitard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.21,0:58:32.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没说错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I correct?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.43,0:58:47.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你其实不用等我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to wait up for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.97,0:58:49.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要等 - 真的不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, I do. - No, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.54,0:58:50.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用 要等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.91,0:58:52.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 你去哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.42,0:58:53.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.57,0:58:55.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡蛋买了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get the eggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.75,0:58:58.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没 我忘记买了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. Forgot the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.90,0:58:59.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在去买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get them now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.81,0:59:01.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用 你不需要去买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you most certainly will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.81,0:59:03.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都这么晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at this hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.83,0:59:07.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.33,0:59:11.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把帽子摘下来 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take off the damn hood and look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.42,0:59:22.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 你去哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter. Where do you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.01,0:59:24.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁吧你打成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who does this to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.64,0:59:26.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去睡觉吧 梅姨妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please go to sleep, Aunt May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.49,0:59:28.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 告诉我 - 梅姨妈 求你了去睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please tell me. - Aunt May, please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.38,0:59:30.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 求你 去睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...please, please go to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.18,0:59:33.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我睡不着 你不明白吗 我睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't sleep. Don't you understand? I can't sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.22,0:59:47.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.28,0:59:49.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,秘密是要付出代价的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secrets have a cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.66,0:59:51.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有例外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not for free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.56,0:59:53.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在没有 以后也不会有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now, not ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.53,1:00:03.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跨种族遗传开始起作用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cross-species genetics is finally working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.88,1:00:07.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我用了蜥蜴的DNA来帮助弗莱迪那条腿的再生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've used the lizard DNA to help Freddy regrow that limb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.39,1:00:08.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.80,1:00:10.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 这是努力研究的成功 也是希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's hard work and promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.89,1:00:14.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们离灵长类动物实验更近了一步 - 他可没时间等你小步前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a step closer to the primate lab. - He doesn't have time for every little step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.98,1:00:15.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.64,1:00:17.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想说他没法等了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just mean he can't wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.38,1:00:18.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是 他必须耐心等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he'll have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.65,1:00:21.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除非他想成为一只小白鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless he wants to be a lab rat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.22,1:00:21.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我所说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.98,1:00:23.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.62,1:00:25.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你的意思是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.26,1:00:27.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得开始做人体实验了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to start human trials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.29,1:00:29.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.12,1:00:31.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不想 也不会这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't, and no, I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.52,1:00:33.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那么 他就必死无疑了 - 人总有一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, then he's going to die. - People die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.00,1:00:36.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺曼?奥斯本也不例外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even Norman Osborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.67,1:00:38.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我话还没说完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.01,1:00:39.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人体实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human trials?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.45,1:00:41.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你准备上哪儿去找自愿实验者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going to find the people to volunteer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.97,1:00:45.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就说是一个流感疫苗 谁在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as anyone's concerned, it's for a flu shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.25,1:00:48.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得可以先在退伍军人医院里试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might think the Veterans Hospital is a place to start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.40,1:00:50.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.91,1:00:52.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不觉得我在开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.40,1:01:00.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在才觉得震惊愤怒可有点迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a little late for shock and indignation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.57,1:01:02.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迟了15年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 15 years late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.29,1:01:04.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全不知道你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.23,1:01:05.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,理查德?帕克把这番话说得正义凛然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard Parker wore it well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.88,1:01:08.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可你说出来就显得虚伪做作了 和当初一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On you, it's a cheap suit, as it was then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.58,1:01:10.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这和我没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had nothing to do with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.04,1:01:12.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对他的儿子彼得也这么说的么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you told his son, Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.69,1:01:19.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.42,1:01:21.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道 还是你不想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know, or you don't wanna know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.19,1:01:24.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我来提醒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll remind you what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.74,1:01:29.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,理查德?帕克也说过你刚才所说的那番话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard Parker said just about the same thing then that you are saying now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.68,1:01:34.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的时间不多了 康纳斯博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The clock is ticking, Dr. Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.69,1:01:37.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.13,1:01:46.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.09,1:01:50.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.10,1:01:57.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总之方程式现在是属于公司的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The formula is ours now anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.97,1:02:01.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和你那条做梦都想长出来的胳膊说再见吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say goodbye to that arm you have dreamed of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.94,1:02:03.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你被开除了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm shutting you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.97,1:02:06.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明早之前把你的办公室腾出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have your office cleared out by the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.91,1:02:09.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你那些小宠物也可以带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your toys can be taken away too, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.19,1:02:13.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧 弗莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, Freddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.62,1:02:29.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.01,1:02:30.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最近还好么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.99,1:02:32.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you headed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.19,1:02:35.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 周一 去玩场地自行车 - 噢 今天是周四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Monday, B track. - Oh, it's Thursday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.24,1:02:37.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 今天周四 - 发生什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's Thursday? - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.93,1:02:39.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么 - 你的眼睛 看上去有点淤青\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Your eye, it looks bruised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.40,1:02:40.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是啊 不 我不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, no, I don't....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.17,1:02:42.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是得了皮疹之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I got a rash or....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.03,1:02:44.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很严重啊 你去看校医了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bad. Have you gone to the nurse?{\r}
