Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.03,1:08:56.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那你的意思呢 - 他只是想帮助别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you trying to say? - He's trying to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.59,1:08:58.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是在试着做一些警察做不到的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to do something the police can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.01,1:08:59.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警察做不到的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something the police can't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.82,1:09:01.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我也不知道 - 你以为我们整天在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - What do you think we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.33,1:09:03.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,围成圈一边吃甜甜圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit around eating doughnuts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.00,1:09:04.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一边摸自己屁股吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with our thumbs planted up our asses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.57,1:09:06.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 乔治 乔治 - 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- George. George. - Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.63,1:09:07.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 摸啥 - 霍华德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Up your what? - Howard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.87,1:09:09.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他的立场和您一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stands for what you stand for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.22,1:09:11.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,保护那些无辜的人不受坏人欺负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protecting innocent people from bad guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.89,1:09:14.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的立场就是捍卫法律和秩序 那是我的立场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stand for law and order. That's what I stand for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.12,1:09:15.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白么 我戴着警徽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? I wear a badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.87,1:09:18.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而那家伙戴着面具 像个亡命之徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy wears a mask like an outlaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.26,1:09:21.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他捉的那群犯人看起来都是一个模子里印出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hunting down criminals that all look the same...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.76,1:09:23.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就好像他是为了报私仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Iike he's got some sort of personal vendetta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.11,1:09:26.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而非保护无辜的人 帕克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's not protecting innocent people, Mr. Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.81,1:09:28.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们出去走走吧 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get some air, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.76,1:09:31.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 爸爸 我们需要谈谈 - 是的 我们得谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad, we need to talk. - Yes, we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.48,1:09:35.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢您的邀请 如果言语有冒犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for having me. I'm sorry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.99,1:09:38.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要见怪 这并非我本意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if I insulted you. It was not my intention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.00,1:09:42.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没关系 - 柠檬鲈鱼很美味 斯泰茜夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're welcome. - Branzino was real good, Mrs. Stacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.41,1:09:43.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢您 - 不用客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.09,1:09:47.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 爸爸 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.15,1:09:56.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才真要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that was something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.66,1:10:01.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 我刚才还以为他会逮捕我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I thought he was going to arrest me at one point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.74,1:10:03.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不会让他逮捕你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I wouldn't have let him arrest you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.29,1:10:11.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的脸怎么了 - 我有些事要告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to your face? - I wanna tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.89,1:10:14.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.20,1:10:21.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我被咬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been bitten....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.65,1:10:26.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So have l.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.83,1:10:32.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.14,1:10:37.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 好吧 好吧 我真的要告诉你一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, okay. I gotta tell you this one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.51,1:10:39.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这件事是关于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta tell you this thing about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.53,1:10:42.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 正义使者和偷车贼的 - 哦 我听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...the vigilante and the car thief. - Oh, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.46,1:10:43.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.40,1:10:46.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 不 不 - 我不想谈那个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no, no. - I don't want to talk about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.85,1:10:48.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不提了 我不说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget that. I won't talk about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.34,1:10:50.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我来谈谈我自己 行吗 - 关于你的什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna talk about me, okay? - What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.27,1:10:54.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不可 我希望我可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's impo-- I wish I could just--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.23,1:10:56.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说不出口 太难表达了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. It's hard to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.60,1:10:57.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只管说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.45,1:10:59.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不知道 - 说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - Say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.70,1:11:03.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.15,1:11:08.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.57,1:11:14.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 不说这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, then forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.55,1:11:25.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.35,1:11:35.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你就是蜘蛛侠 - 别闹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're Spider-Man. - Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.36,1:11:41.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格温\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gwen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.27,1:11:44.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格温\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gwen....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.80,1:11:47.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸想让你进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father wants you to come inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.07,1:11:48.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.12,1:11:50.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 行吗 - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.06,1:11:53.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格温\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.04,1:11:55.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.25,1:12:28.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.64,1:12:53.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.63,1:12:56.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去看看发生什么了吗 阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...find out what is going on, Alfred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.12,1:13:04.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.90,1:13:07.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.84,1:13:12.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.50,1:13:14.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 上帝啊 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God! - I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.29,1:13:15.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到车里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back in the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.58,1:13:21.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.55,1:13:25.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.51,1:14:07.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.52,1:14:29.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快来个人帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.80,1:14:31.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救命 我的孩子被困住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! My kid is trapped!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.54,1:14:42.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.72,1:14:44.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.77,1:14:45.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 嘿 嘿 - 救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, hey, hey. - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.80,1:14:46.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.34,1:14:48.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 冷静下来 - 走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's okay. - Get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.53,1:14:50.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 救命 - 嘿 你瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help! - Hey, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.00,1:14:53.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是一个普通人 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a normal guy, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.67,1:14:56.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想拿着这个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna hold this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.50,1:14:58.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着我的面具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold my mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.88,1:14:59.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.35,1:15:02.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.20,1:15:04.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.73,1:15:06.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 让我把你从这儿弄出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Let's get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.74,1:15:09.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 你稳住 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, stay very still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.43,1:15:10.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.39,1:15:11.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我抓住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.07,1:15:17.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.08,1:15:19.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会解开安全带 等会儿你就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll undo the belt. You hold on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.08,1:15:21.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓住前面的座位 我数三声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to that seat in front of you. On three?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.14,1:15:24.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 - 开始了 一 二 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - Okay, one, two, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.48,1:15:28.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看 很容易吧 你做得很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See how easy that was? You did a great job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.52,1:15:29.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题了 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.59,1:15:45.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 快爬上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, climb now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.15,1:15:46.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我害怕 - 你可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't. - Yes, you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.54,1:15:54.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴上面具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it on, the mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.21,1:15:55.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它会给你力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna make you strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.61,1:15:58.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.08,1:15:59.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴上它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.82,1:16:02.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样 伙计 就这样 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go. That's it. That's it, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.57,1:16:03.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就现在 快爬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, now, climb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.05,1:16:05.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加把劲 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.42,1:16:09.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就当帮我个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do me a favour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.41,1:16:10.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爬快点儿 行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little faster, okay, bud?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.12,1:16:13.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很好 伙计 你做得可棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing great, buddy. You're doing great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.45,1:16:14.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那样 保持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Keep coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.71,1:16:15.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爬上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.65,1:16:17.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续爬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.55,1:16:19.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
