Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.81,1:23:16.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道是谁 - 柯蒂斯·康纳斯博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know who? - Dr. Curtis Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.75,1:23:18.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他是个生物学家 - 奥斯的那位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's a biochemist. - Of Oscorp?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.14,1:23:19.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没错 - 康纳斯博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's right. - Dr. Connors...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.22,1:23:22.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,曾经是我女儿的导师 你说的就是他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who's my daughter's mentor. Is that who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.39,1:23:23.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就是他 - 明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's the one. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.40,1:23:26.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最近 康纳斯博士帮格温写了一封大学推荐信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recently, Dr. Connors gave Gwen a college recommendation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.90,1:23:28.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那文笔太美了 看得我都哭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was beautiful. When I read it, I cried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.98,1:23:31.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你现在要我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would have me believe that he...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.62,1:23:33.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他cos成恐龙的样子到处跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is running around dressed up like a dinosaur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.79,1:23:37.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是cos 也不是恐龙 他是把自己改造成一只巨大的蜥蜴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not dressing up and not a dinosaur. He has transformed himself into a lizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.58,1:23:42.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我先问你一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask you a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.18,1:23:44.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看起来像东京的市长吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like the mayor of Tokyo to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.83,1:23:47.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在告诉你千真万确的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you the absolute truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.08,1:23:51.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个男人一生都在做交叉物种的研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man has worked for his whole life on cross-species genetics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.13,1:23:55.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他没了一条胳膊 所以努力想让它重新长出来 但那方程式并不均衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lost an arm, he tried to grow it back, but the equation was imbalanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.27,1:23:57.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,导致他变成了一只蜥蜴人 他在使用蜥蜴的基因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has turned into a lizard. He's using lizard DNA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.72,1:24:01.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他非常危险 而且他现在在策划一些可怕的事 我很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is dangerous, and he is planning something horrific. I know. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.89,1:24:03.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 好吧 我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. All right, I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.10,1:24:06.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们接下来就这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what we'll do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.63,1:24:09.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你回去陪东京市民游山玩水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll go back to hanging out with the citizens of Tokyo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.59,1:24:12.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我就回去保护我们这座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go back to protecting the citizens...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.47,1:24:14.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美丽的城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of this fine, fair city of ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.41,1:24:16.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴特勒警官 你可以帮我送帕克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant Butler, please escort Mr. Parker...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.61,1:24:19.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 回学校吗 - 斯特西队长 我并不是来捣乱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...back to school. - Captain Stacy, I'm not messing around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.71,1:24:22.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他带过来询问他 打电话叫他来 一定要叫他来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just bring him in. Just call him in. You have to call him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.72,1:24:24.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个危险人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a danger to everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.13,1:24:27.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托 相信我 - 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just, please, listen to me. - Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.27,1:24:32.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.96,1:24:36.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把手头上有的柯蒂斯·康纳斯的所有东西都给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me everything we have on Dr. Curtis Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.01,1:24:38.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 行吗 现在就要 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay? Right away. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.72,1:25:06.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,实验对象 柯蒂斯·康纳斯博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject: Dr. Curtis Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.94,1:25:08.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,体温89.7\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Current temperature: 89.7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.88,1:25:10.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,稳定48小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady for 48 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.20,1:25:12.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,血液分析显示 淋巴细胞和单核细胞的文本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood panels reveal lymphocyte and monocyte readings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.97,1:25:14.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都包含以往的主体的信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...consistent with subject's past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.37,1:25:22.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凝血速度迅速提高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clotting rate vastly improved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.19,1:25:23.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,肌肉反应 力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marked enhancement...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.93,1:25:25.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,灵活性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in muscle response...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.12,1:25:26.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有显著提升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...strength and elasticity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.61,1:25:36.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,视力得到相应改进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyesight similarly improved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.81,1:25:39.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,实验对象无需再佩戴视力矫正镜片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject no longer requires corrective lenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.50,1:25:46.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是寻找治疗疾病的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no longer about curing ills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.03,1:25:48.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.11,1:25:49.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,寻找完美物种之路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...finding perfection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.91,1:26:01.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尝试阻止旧病复发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In attempt to redress regenerative relapse...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.36,1:26:05.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,剂量增加到200毫克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...dosage has been increased to 200 milligrams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.84,1:27:41.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你曾阻止我一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stopped me once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.62,1:27:44.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一次 你不能再阻扰我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't stop me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.88,1:27:49.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一天比一天强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting stronger every day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.70,1:28:30.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 真要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that sucked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.53,1:28:43.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得?帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.16,1:29:01.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.68,1:29:05.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你本应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should maybe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.03,1:29:07.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,考虑光明正大地进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...consider coming in through the lobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.96,1:29:13.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另外 我爸爸总觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also, my father is under the impression...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.44,1:29:15.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是时候该去看看心理医生 - 哦 真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...that you require psychiatric attention. - Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.24,1:29:17.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.14,1:29:19.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.40,1:29:20.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另外一个人比我还惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should see the other guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.50,1:29:26.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个人 他突然从人变成了一只巨大的蜥蜴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other guy, in this instance, being a giant mutant lizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.92,1:29:28.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 格温 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Gwen, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.06,1:29:29.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要杯可可吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want cocoa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.42,1:29:31.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,霍华德泡了一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howard's making some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.65,1:29:36.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 爸爸 我不想喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Dad, I do not want cocoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.64,1:29:38.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另外 我已经17岁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, I'm 17 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.58,1:29:39.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.77,1:29:43.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我记得上周不知道是谁说 她总是幻想住在巧克力房子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remembered somebody saying her fantasy was to live in a chocolate house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.20,1:29:44.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是不现实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's impractical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.81,1:29:46.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且会变胖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And fattening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.91,1:29:51.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巧克力房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chocolate house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.93,1:29:55.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉爸爸 - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry, Dad. - It's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.75,1:29:58.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能喝可可 因为我现在有些事忙着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't have cocoa right now because I'm work--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.88,1:30:01.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在忙着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing this....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.24,1:30:03.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我痛经了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have cramps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.11,1:30:07.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在很难受 而且有点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel kind of pukey and just sort of....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.31,1:30:09.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就是有点情绪波动 就像在哭一样 - 好吧 我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like, emotional. I keep crying. - It's okay. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.10,1:30:10.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就这样 - 痛得很厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good. - It's brutal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.86,1:30:13.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不会想知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.49,1:30:14.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那种感觉就像 - 明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's, like, bad. - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.09,1:30:16.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢理解 - 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, Daddy. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.98,1:30:43.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放松点 见习骑师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, Bug Boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.31,1:30:46.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚叫我什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.78,1:30:53.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.48,1:30:56.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有事 有事 - 没事 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. No. - Yes. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.71,1:30:59.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.33,1:31:01.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.55,1:31:05.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每天 我记得的每一天 我爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day, for as long as I can remember, my father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.16,1:31:07.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每天早上的时候都会出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has left every morning...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.26,1:31:09.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他把徽章别在胸口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he's put a badge on his chest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.01,1:31:11.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,腰上戴着他的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and strapped a gun to his hip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.35,1:31:17.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后每天 自从记事开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every day, for as long as I can remember...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.30,1:31:19.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直担心他就这样一去不回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I haven't known if he was gonna make it home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.71,1:31:30.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.69,1:31:33.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.00,1:31:36.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.80,1:31:40.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我必须阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta stop him, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.17,1:31:44.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不这样做 因为是我创造了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to, because I created him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.25,1:31:49.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
