Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.55,1:59:43.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎有一些粉状的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, some sort of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.24,1:59:46.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,雾化解毒剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...aerosolised antidote was launched from...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.22,1:59:49.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从奥斯塔洒下 目测这些粉状物直接抵消了生物毒素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Oscorp Tower, which seems to have counteracted the biotoxins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.25,1:59:52.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,曼哈顿下城区的居民可以回复平静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Residents of Lower Manhattan can rest peacefully...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.98,1:59:54.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这次恐怖事件的策划者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...knowing that the alleged mastermind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.73,1:59:58.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,柯蒂斯·康纳斯教授已被逮捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... of this terror plot, Dr. Curtis Connors, is behind bars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.59,2:00:00.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰?奈尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got John Niles...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.05,2:00:03.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在曼哈顿下城区为您播报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... on the street for a report in Lower Manhattan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.18,2:00:04.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 你看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, what do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.74,2:00:39.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart, it's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.11,2:00:43.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.18,2:00:46.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都会好起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.03,2:00:48.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,忙了一夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rough night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.66,2:00:51.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.64,2:01:46.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.34,2:01:50.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.65,2:01:57.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.39,2:02:03.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚举行了葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a funeral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.62,2:02:10.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们鸣枪致敬 发表悼词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They shot off rifles and they made speeches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.10,2:02:16.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两位老师也去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two of my teachers showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.47,2:02:19.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弗莱舍 弗莱舍也去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flash...And Flash showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.81,2:02:26.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了你 所有人都去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone was there but you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.84,2:02:34.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.11,2:02:43.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能去 我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do this, I can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.54,2:02:47.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.70,2:02:48.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.02,2:02:49.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.27,2:02:51.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再和你见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't see you any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.14,2:02:54.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.12,2:03:22.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他让你答应他 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made you promise, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.03,2:03:28.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从此远离我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To stay away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.67,2:03:30.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就能安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'd be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.50,2:03:58.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多么美的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a pretty girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.47,2:03:59.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.88,2:04:02.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本恩叔叔也这么说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's what Uncle Ben said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.60,2:04:04.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你约她出去了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ask her out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.07,2:04:09.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.38,2:04:11.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.11,2:04:14.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.09,2:04:19.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和我在一起对她不会幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just no good for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.01,2:04:26.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得?帕克 她只要和你在一起 就会幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter Parker, if there's one thing you are, it's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.54,2:04:29.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任何对此有怀疑的人都可以找我谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone has a problem with that can talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.12,2:04:51.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 我知道最近事情多有不顺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, I know things have been difficult lately,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.04,2:04:54.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对此很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.62,2:04:57.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道你的感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I know what you're feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.49,2:05:00.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从你还是个孩子的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since you were a little boy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.18,2:05:04.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的生活就一直伴随着那么多的麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've been living with so many unresolved things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.97,2:05:08.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 曾经有人说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, take it from an old man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.15,2:05:12.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些让我们陷入低谷的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}those things send us down the road,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.08,2:05:14.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也会成就我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make us who we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.61,2:05:20.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人注定要成为伟大的人 那一定是你 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if anyone's destined for greatness, it's you son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.53,2:05:27.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是上天赐予你的礼物 你必须弄明白如何使用它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You owe the world your gifts, you just have to figure out how to use them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.86,2:05:30.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要知道无论它将你带出多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And know that wherever they take you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.48,2:05:32.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都一直在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll always be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.73,2:05:36.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 回家吧彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So come on home Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.78,2:05:40.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的英雄 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my hero and I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.86,2:05:52.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 早上好 帕克 - 嘿 还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello Parker. - Hey, how's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.38,2:05:54.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进展不错 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're coming along, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.22,2:05:58.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这衣服真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a cool shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.00,2:06:00.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.04,2:06:02.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那男的够牛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dude's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.24,2:06:04.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是小妞都喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But chicks dig him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.15,2:06:22.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一位教授曾经告诉过他的学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a professor once who liked to tell his students that there were only{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.76,2:06:25.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的小说都逃不脱十种剧情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ten different plots in all of fiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.70,2:06:30.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我告诉你们他错了 剧情只有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I'm here to tell you he was wrong, there is only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.12,2:06:32.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.37,2:06:36.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕克先生 你又迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Parker, tardy again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.34,2:06:40.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 至少你还是来上课了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at least we can always count on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.32,2:06:42.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 瑞特女士 不会有下次了 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry Miss Ritter, it won't happen again, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.77,2:06:44.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别许你做不到的承诺 帕克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make promises you can't keep, Mr. Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.89,2:06:49.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 但承诺是最好听的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but those are the best kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.98,2:06:53.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了同学们 打开课本 我们从第一页开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay class, open your books, let's begin on page 1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.53,2:07:58.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.40,2:09:50.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.87,2:09:54.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你告诉那个男孩了吗 - 告诉他什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you tell the boy? - Tell him what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.68,2:09:58.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于他父亲的真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you tell the boy the truth about his father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.98,2:10:02.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有 - 那真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Well that's very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.14,2:10:04.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在差不多是时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we'll let him be for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.32,2:10:08.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该离他远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should leave him alone!{\r}
